From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 16:33:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] build: accept IBus 1.5.29

Ubuntu 24.04 ships IBus 1.5.29. The Gnoblin IBus input method in
src/input/method maps preedit hints, which IBus 1.5.33 added, and leaves
that code out with an older IBus. Without this change the build silently
left the IBus input method out on Ubuntu 24.04.

Nothing is lost compared with IBus 1.5.31: below 1.5.33 the preedit has
no hint styles.

---
diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index fd7f84b70..8613f9da2 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -122,7 +122,7 @@ hyprcursor_dep = dependency('hyprcursor', version: '>= 0.1.11', required: get_op
 have_hyprcursor = hyprcursor_dep.found()
 if have_hyprcursor
 endif
-ibus_dep = dependency('ibus-1.0', version: '>= 1.5.31', required: get_option('ibus'))
+ibus_dep = dependency('ibus-1.0', version: '>= 1.5.29', required: get_option('ibus'))
 have_ibus = ibus_dep.found()
 pixman_dep = dependency('pixman-1', version: pixman_req)
 gsettings_desktop_schemas_dep = dependency('gsettings-desktop-schemas',
